{"version":1,"content":"<p>Google搜索正式推出可摺疊側邊欄，方便用户快速回到最近的AI搜索記錄。該功能首先在桌面版首頁面向全球用户逐步上線，Google稱其目的是讓用户更容易找到並繼續此前在AI模式中進行的搜索。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587244.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T08:24:03.331848+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T07:57:47+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:15.596863+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T08:17:15.596863+00:00","content_hash":"7839e793e77ccc2d0a2b0f905ebc864738314791a98bab865b79eaeedaa3e60a","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}